#. 戦刃むくろは…
#. <CLT 9>超高校級の軍人<CLT>よ…
msgctxt "0001 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"Mukuro w-was\n"
"the <CLT 9>Ultimate Soldier<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. 幾多の戦場を練り歩いた…
#. 兵士なのよ…
msgctxt "0002 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"She must've been in\n"
"a h-hundred different battles."
msgstr ""

#. つまり…死体にある
#. 全身の傷は…
msgctxt "0003 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "So when you th-think about it..."
msgstr ""

#. 当然…<CLT 9>戦場で受けた傷<CLT>
#. だったのよ！
msgctxt "0004 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"Obviously she g-got \n"
"<CLT 9>all those wounds in battle<CLT>!"
msgstr ""

#. もう終わった？
msgctxt "0005 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Are you finished?"
msgstr ""

#. ひ、否定すらしにゃい
#. にゃんて…！
msgctxt "0006 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"You didn't d-deny me\n"
"this timesy wimesy!"
msgstr ""

#. ほら…かわいい噛み方
#. しちゃったじゃない！
msgctxt "0007 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Agh! You made me go all cutesy!"
msgstr ""

#. 安心しろ。
#. どこもかわいくねーべ。
msgctxt "0008 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"Don't worry.\n"
"There wasn't anything cute about it."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>そうね、それは否定しないわ。<CLT>
msgctxt "0009 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "<CLT 26>I certainly can't deny that...<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>言われなくても分かっている。<CLT>
msgctxt "0010 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "<CLT 26>You didn't even have to say anything...<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>軍人が殺されるって…<CLT>
msgctxt "0011 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "<CLT 26>The Ultimate Soldier was killed...<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>殺した奴はさらに…強い？<CLT>
msgctxt "0012 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "<CLT 26>Does that mean her killer is even stronger?<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>同年代とは思えねーべ。<CLT>
msgctxt "0013 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "<CLT 26>I can't believe we're even the same age...<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>戦場なんて普通じゃないよね…<CLT>
msgctxt "0014 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "<CLT 26>This whole thing is just...surreal...<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>だが…超高校級の軍人が…<CLT>
msgctxt "0015 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "<CLT 26>But...the Ultimate Soldier?<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>果たして本当に…<CLT>
msgctxt "0016 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "<CLT 26>And you know, to be honest...<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>ボクのほうがかわいいからね！<CLT>
msgctxt "0017 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "<CLT 26>I think I'm way cuter!<CLT>"
msgstr ""
